"py-2\">name_short</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[-]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Kurzname "
"der Station</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">geom</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[-]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Geographiche Position der Station im SRID 4326 Format mit Längengrad "
"Breitengrad und Höhe</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">is_electrifiable</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[bool]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Ist es "
"möglich die Haltestelle zu elektrifizieren? Dieser Wert wird für den "
"Elektrifizierungsoptimierer benötigt.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Erforderlich</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
